  <diagram id="vNkK1Xd_H2e0zBBDSNpY" name="Page-9">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4285" dy="2548" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml ROMS_Workflow2_QR_Scan_To_Food_Served\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Segoe UI\&quot;\nskinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam sequenceMessageAlign center\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nautonumber\n\ntitle SEQUENCE DIAGRAM: WORKFLOW 2 - FROM QR SCAN TO FOOD SERVED\n\nactor \&quot;Customer\&quot; as Guest\nboundary \&quot;:TableWelcomePage\\n(Client Web)\&quot; as GuestUI\nboundary \&quot;:WaiterApp\\n(Waiter Web)\&quot; as WaiterUI\ncontrol \&quot;:CustomerController\\n(REST API)\&quot; as Controller\ncontrol \&quot;:CustomerService\\n(Service Layer)\&quot; as Service\ndatabase \&quot;:Database\\n(SQL Server)\&quot; as DB\nqueue \&quot;:RealtimeService\\n(STOMP Broker)\&quot; as WS\nboundary \&quot;:KitchenKdsPage\\n(Kitchen KDS)\&quot; as KDS\nactor \&quot;Waiter\&quot; as Waiter\nactor \&quot;Chef\&quot; as Chef\n\n== PHASE 1: QR CODE SCAN &amp; DINING SESSION CHECK-IN ==\nGuest -&gt; GuestUI: 1. Scan dynamic QR code at table (qrToken)\nactivate GuestUI\nGuestUI -&gt; Controller: POST /api/customer/tables/verify-qr { qrToken }\nactivate Controller\nController -&gt; Service: verifyQrToken(qrToken)\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; DB: findByQrToken(qrToken)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Service: RestaurantTable (status, isActive)\ndeactivate DB\n\nalt #White Table not yet opened (TableStatus == AVAILABLE)\n    Service --&gt; Controller: TableResponse (AVAILABLE, diningToken=null)\n    Controller --&gt; GuestUI: 200 OK\n    GuestUI --&gt; Guest: Display welcome screen &amp; \&quot;Call Waiter\&quot; prompt\n    \n    Guest -&gt; GuestUI: Tap \&quot;Call Waiter to Open Table\&quot;\n    GuestUI -&gt; Controller: POST /customer/dining/call-waiter { \&quot;OPEN_TABLE\&quot; }\n    Controller -&gt; WS: notifyServiceRequest(CALL_WAITER, tableId)\n    activate WS\n    WS --&gt; WaiterUI: Audio chime &amp; pulsating table card\n    deactivate WS\n\n    Waiter -&gt; WaiterUI: Tap \&quot;Open Table\&quot; (POST /open)\n    activate WaiterUI\n    WaiterUI -&gt; Controller: POST /api/waiter/tables/{id}/open\n    Controller -&gt; Service: openTableSession(tableId)\n    Service -&gt; DB: Create DiningSession (ACTIVE), TableStatus.OCCUPIED\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; Service: Saved OK\n    deactivate DB\n    Service -&gt; WS: notifyTableUpdate(tableId, OCCUPIED)\n    activate WS\n    WS --&gt; GuestUI: STOMP: TABLE_UPDATE (status = OCCUPIED)\n    deactivate WS\n    deactivate WaiterUI\n\n    GuestUI -&gt; Controller: Auto re-verify QR ➔ Receive diningToken (JWT)\n    GuestUI -&gt; GuestUI: Save diningToken to sessionStorage\nelse #White Table already opened (TableStatus == OCCUPIED)\n    Service --&gt; Controller: Grant diningToken immediately (JWT)\nend\nGuestUI --&gt; Guest: Auto-redirect to Menu (/dining/menu)\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Controller\ndeactivate GuestUI\n\n== PHASE 2: MENU BROWSING, AI ASSISTANT &amp; ORDER PLACEMENT ==\nopt #White Guest consults AI Dining Assistant\n    Guest -&gt; GuestUI: Open ROMS Bot: \&quot;Recommend grilled dishes for 2 guests\&quot;\n    activate GuestUI\n    GuestUI -&gt; Controller: POST /api/customer/dining/ai/recommend\n    activate Controller\n    Controller -&gt; Service: Tailor recommendations from active menu &amp; stock\n    Service --&gt; Controller: Recommendation response with interactive dish cards\n    Controller --&gt; GuestUI: 200 OK\n    GuestUI --&gt; Guest: Interactive cards ➔ Tap \&quot;+ Add to Cart\&quot;\n    deactivate Controller\n    deactivate GuestUI\nend\n\nGuest -&gt; GuestUI: 2. Confirm order batch (Tap \&quot;Place Order\&quot;)\nactivate GuestUI\nGuestUI -&gt; Controller: POST /api/customer/dining/orders\\nHeaders: Bearer [diningToken]\\nBody: CustomerPlaceOrderRequest\nactivate Controller\nController -&gt; Service: placeOrder(request)\nactivate Service\n\nService -&gt; DB: findByTableIdAndStatus(tableId, ACTIVE)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Service: DiningSession ACTIVE\ndeactivate DB\n\nloop For each ordered item\n    Service -&gt; DB: menuItemRepository.findById(menuItemId)\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; Service: MenuItem (price, remainingStock, isAvailable)\n    deactivate DB\n    Service -&gt; Service: Verify availability &amp; decrease stock (decreaseStock)\n    opt #White Item out of stock (remainingStock &lt;= 0)\n        Service -&gt; Service: Mark 86&#39;d (isAvailable = false)\n        Service -&gt; WS: notifyMenuItemAvailability(itemId, false)\n    end\n    Service -&gt; Service: Lock unit price from DB\nend\n\nService -&gt; DB: Save Order (status = SUBMITTED)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Service: Order Saved\ndeactivate DB\n\nService -&gt; WS: notifyKitchenOrder(orderId, ORDER_NEW)\nactivate WS\nWS --&gt; KDS: STOMP: Dispatch new ticket + Ding-Dong chime\ndeactivate WS\n\nService --&gt; Controller: CustomerOrderTrackingResponse\ndeactivate Service\nController --&gt; GuestUI: 200 OK\ndeactivate Controller\nGuestUI --&gt; Guest: Redirect to live tracking screen (/dining/orders/tracking)\ndeactivate GuestUI\n\n== PHASE 3: KITCHEN PREPARATION &amp; FOOD SERVING TO TABLE ==\nChef -&gt; KDS: 3. Chef taps \&quot;Start Cooking\&quot; on KDS ticket\nactivate KDS\nKDS -&gt; Controller: PUT /api/kitchen/orders/{id}/status { status: \&quot;COOKING\&quot; }\nactivate Controller\nController -&gt; Service: updateOrderStatus(orderId, \&quot;COOKING\&quot;)\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; DB: order.setStatus(COOKING), items.setStatus(COOKING)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Service: Updated OK\ndeactivate DB\nService -&gt; WS: notifyOrderStatus(orderId, COOKING)\nactivate WS\nWS --&gt; GuestUI: STOMP: Real-time update \&quot;Cooking in progress\&quot;\ndeactivate WS\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Controller\ndeactivate KDS\n\nChef -&gt; KDS: 4. Chef completes dish preparation (Tap \&quot;Ready\&quot;)\nactivate KDS\nKDS -&gt; Controller: PUT /api/kitchen/items/{itemId}/status { status: \&quot;READY\&quot; }\nactivate Controller\nController -&gt; Service: updateItemStatus(itemId, \&quot;READY\&quot;)\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; DB: item.setStatus(READY)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Service: Updated OK\ndeactivate DB\nService -&gt; WS: notifyOrderStatus(READY, itemId)\nactivate WS\nWS --&gt; WaiterUI: STOMP: Table card displays \&quot;FOOD_READY\&quot; badge\nWS --&gt; GuestUI: STOMP: Live update \&quot;Dish ready — Serving to table\&quot;\ndeactivate WS\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Controller\ndeactivate KDS\n\nChef -&gt; Waiter: Transfer plated dish to Pass counter\nWaiter -&gt; Guest: 5. Deliver plated dish to dining table\nWaiter -&gt; WaiterUI: 6. Tap \&quot;Confirm Served\&quot; (POST /deliver-food)\nactivate WaiterUI\nWaiterUI -&gt; Controller: POST /api/waiter/tables/{id}/deliver-food\nactivate Controller\nController -&gt; Service: confirmDeliverFood(tableId)\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; DB: items.setStatus(SERVED)\\nIf all items served ➔ order.setStatus(SERVED)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Service: Updated OK\ndeactivate DB\nService -&gt; WS: notifyOrderStatus(orderId, SERVED)\nactivate WS\nWS --&gt; GuestUI: STOMP: Progress bar reaches 100% \&quot;FOOD SERVED\&quot;\ndeactivate WS\nService --&gt; Controller: 200 OK\ndeactivate Service\nController --&gt; WaiterUI: Delivery Confirmed\ndeactivate Controller\ndeactivate WaiterUI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ZSOOUz1DADMxCTxdpekz-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
